{"real": true, "dur": 71.01, "sent": [{"start": 0.26, "end": 7.56, "text": "Still, there are two more categories I need, because textbooks don’t cover everything teachers want to teach.", "words": [{"w": "Still,", "s": 0.26}, {"w": "there", "s": 1.24}, {"w": "are", "s": 1.42}, {"w": "two", "s": 1.62}, {"w": "more", "s": 1.82}, {"w": "categories", "s": 2.02}, {"w": "I", "s": 2.74}, {"w": "need,", "s": 2.86}, {"w": "because", "s": 3.66}, {"w": "textbooks", "s": 4.32}, {"w": "don’t", "s": 5.04}, {"w": "cover", "s": 5.3}, {"w": "everything", "s": 5.74}, {"w": "teachers", "s": 6.48}, {"w": "want", "s": 6.96}, {"w": "to", "s": 7.1}, {"w": "teach.", "s": 7.26}]}, {"start": 8.46, "end": 13.44, "text": "The first is bonus material: things beyond the book that are still useful.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 8.46}, {"w": "first", "s": 8.66}, {"w": "is", "s": 9.16}, {"w": "bonus", "s": 9.38}, {"w": "material:", "s": 9.76}, {"w": "things", "s": 11.04}, {"w": "beyond", "s": 11.38}, {"w": "the", "s": 11.78}, {"w": "book", "s": 11.9}, {"w": "that", "s": 12.36}, {"w": "are", "s": 12.56}, {"w": "still", "s": 12.76}, {"w": "useful.", "s": 13.04}]}, {"start": 13.92, "end": 19.64, "text": "They’re labelled “bonus” on screen, never marked, and never needed to finish a step.", "words": [{"w": "They’re", "s": 13.92}, {"w": "labelled", "s": 14.16}, {"w": "“bonus”", "s": 14.54}, {"w": "on", "s": 15.34}, {"w": "screen,", "s": 15.56}, {"w": "never", "s": 16.5}, {"w": "marked,", "s": 16.8}, {"w": "and", "s": 17.56}, {"w": "never", "s": 17.8}, {"w": "needed", "s": 18.14}, {"w": "to", "s": 18.54}, {"w": "finish", "s": 18.74}, {"w": "a", "s": 19.14}, {"w": "step.", "s": 19.32}]}, {"start": 20.18, "end": 26.26, "text": "For example, the book has almost no school subjects, but my students want to introduce themselves.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 20.18}, {"w": "example,", "s": 20.32}, {"w": "the", "s": 21.28}, {"w": "book", "s": 21.42}, {"w": "has", "s": 21.62}, {"w": "almost", "s": 21.88}, {"w": "no", "s": 22.3}, {"w": "school", "s": 22.58}, {"w": "subjects,", "s": 22.9}, {"w": "but", "s": 23.82}, {"w": "my", "s": 24.0}, {"w": "students", "s": 24.26}, {"w": "want", "s": 24.76}, {"w": "to", "s": 24.96}, {"w": "introduce", "s": 25.14}, {"w": "themselves.", "s": 25.64}]}, {"start": 26.72, "end": 32.46, "text": "They want to say things like “I study physics,” in French, as you can see here.", "words": [{"w": "They", "s": 26.72}, {"w": "want", "s": 26.88}, {"w": "to", "s": 27.06}, {"w": "say", "s": 27.22}, {"w": "things", "s": 27.48}, {"w": "like", "s": 27.78}, {"w": "“I", "s": 27.98}, {"w": "study", "s": 28.9}, {"w": "physics,”", "s": 29.28}, {"w": "in", "s": 30.3}, {"w": "French,", "s": 30.48}, {"w": "as", "s": 31.46}, {"w": "you", "s": 31.62}, {"w": "can", "s": 31.74}, {"w": "see", "s": 31.96}, {"w": "here.", "s": 32.18}]}, {"start": 33.1, "end": 36.58, "text": "So school subjects stay in, as bonus.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 33.1}, {"w": "school", "s": 33.72}, {"w": "subjects", "s": 34.06}, {"w": "stay", "s": 34.96}, {"w": "in,", "s": 35.34}, {"w": "as", "s": 35.86}, {"w": "bonus.", "s": 36.1}]}, {"start": 37.22, "end": 39.86, "text": "The second category is the teacher addition.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 37.22}, {"w": "second", "s": 37.4}, {"w": "category", "s": 37.74}, {"w": "is", "s": 38.58}, {"w": "the", "s": 38.74}, {"w": "teacher", "s": 38.92}, {"w": "addition.", "s": 39.36}]}, {"start": 40.3, "end": 44.4, "text": "That’s something I choose to teach, even though it isn’t in the textbook.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 40.3}, {"w": "something", "s": 40.54}, {"w": "I", "s": 40.98}, {"w": "choose", "s": 41.1}, {"w": "to", "s": 41.4}, {"w": "teach,", "s": 41.62}, {"w": "even", "s": 42.58}, {"w": "though", "s": 42.82}, {"w": "it", "s": 43.14}, {"w": "isn’t", "s": 43.34}, {"w": "in", "s": 43.72}, {"w": "the", "s": 43.82}, {"w": "textbook.", "s": 43.94}]}, {"start": 45.3, "end": 49.98, "text": "Unlike bonus material, it’s taught and marked just like book content.", "words": [{"w": "Unlike", "s": 45.3}, {"w": "bonus", "s": 45.76}, {"w": "material,", "s": 46.16}, {"w": "it’s", "s": 47.32}, {"w": "taught", "s": 47.64}, {"w": "and", "s": 48.1}, {"w": "marked", "s": 48.32}, {"w": "just", "s": 48.8}, {"w": "like", "s": 49.02}, {"w": "book", "s": 49.3}, {"w": "content.", "s": 49.52}]}, {"start": 50.44, "end": 57.6, "text": "My first example is “pleased to meet you.” The book never teaches it, but I teach it in the very first lesson.", "words": [{"w": "My", "s": 50.44}, {"w": "first", "s": 50.66}, {"w": "example", "s": 50.88}, {"w": "is", "s": 51.44}, {"w": "“pleased", "s": 51.68}, {"w": "to", "s": 52.54}, {"w": "meet", "s": 52.68}, {"w": "you.”", "s": 52.94}, {"w": "The", "s": 54.04}, {"w": "book", "s": 54.16}, {"w": "never", "s": 54.4}, {"w": "teaches", "s": 54.72}, {"w": "it,", "s": 55.12}, {"w": "but", "s": 55.72}, {"w": "I", "s": 55.92}, {"w": "teach", "s": 56.04}, {"w": "it", "s": 56.26}, {"w": "in", "s": 56.42}, {"w": "the", "s": 56.52}, {"w": "very", "s": 56.7}, {"w": "first", "s": 57.0}, {"w": "lesson.", "s": 57.24}]}, {"start": 58.58, "end": 64.2, "text": "Either way, the catalogue marks each item as either bonus or a teacher addition.", "words": [{"w": "Either", "s": 58.58}, {"w": "way,", "s": 58.84}, {"w": "the", "s": 59.42}, {"w": "catalogue", "s": 59.58}, {"w": "marks", "s": 60.08}, {"w": "each", "s": 60.52}, {"w": "item", "s": 60.9}, {"w": "as", "s": 61.68}, {"w": "either", "s": 61.96}, {"w": "bonus", "s": 62.26}, {"w": "or", "s": 62.92}, {"w": "a", "s": 63.08}, {"w": "teacher", "s": 63.26}, {"w": "addition.", "s": 63.7}]}, {"start": 64.66, "end": 70.24, "text": "That way, the system knows I’ve included it deliberately, rather than by mistake.", "words": [{"w": "That", "s": 64.66}, {"w": "way,", "s": 64.86}, {"w": "the", "s": 65.5}, {"w": "system", "s": 65.66}, {"w": "knows", "s": 66.16}, {"w": "I’ve", "s": 66.64}, {"w": "included", "s": 66.92}, {"w": "it", "s": 67.6}, {"w": "deliberately,", "s": 67.86}, {"w": "rather", "s": 69.04}, {"w": "than", "s": 69.36}, {"w": "by", "s": 69.58}, {"w": "mistake.", "s": 69.76}]}]}